  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Whosoever therefore shall confess me before men, him will I confess, Matt. 10:32 (Luke 12:8). he confessed … I am not the Christ, John 1:20. if any man did confess that he was Christ, John 9:22. because of the Pharisees they did not confess, John 12:42. many that believed came, and confessed, Acts 19:18. confess with thy mouth the Lord … thou shalt be saved, Rom. 10:9. every knee shall bow to me, and every tongue shall confess to God, Rom. 14:11 (Isa. 45:23; Philip. 2:10–11; Mosiah 27:31; D&C 76:110; 88:104). I will confess to thee among the Gentiles, Rom. 15:9. Every spirit that confesseth that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh is of God, 1 Jn. 4:2. confess that Jesus is the Son of God, 1 Jn. 4:15. deceivers … who confess not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh, 2 Jn. 1:7. I will confess his name before my Father, Rev. 3:5.",
